  "sections": {
    "work": [
      {
        "kind": "quote",
        "text": "In 1523, Holbein painted his first portraits of the great Renaissance scholar Erasmus, who required likenesses to send to his friends and admirers throughout Europe.",
        "source": {
          "author": "Wikipedia contributors",
          "title": "Hans Holbein the Younger",
          "readAt": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hans_Holbein_the_Younger",
          "accessed": "2026-11-04",
          "tier": 5,
          "publisher": "Wikipedia",
          "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0"
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "quote",
        "text": "It seems to have been Holbein's practice to make a very careful drawing of his subjects (though no full drawings for any of these portraits survive) and to then produce the painted portrait without the sitter being present.",
        "source": {
          "author": "Wikipedia contributors",
          "title": "Portrait of Erasmus of Rotterdam",
          "readAt": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Portrait_of_Erasmus_of_Rotterdam",
          "accessed": "2026-11-04",
          "tier": 5,
          "publisher": "Wikipedia",
          "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0"
        }
      }
    ],
    "moment": [
      {
        "kind": "quote",
        "text": "Such was the fame of Erasmus, who corresponded with scholars throughout Europe, that he needed many portraits of himself to send abroad to his protectors; although not an admirer of painting, he understood the power of image.",
        "source": {
          "author": "Wikipedia contributors",
          "title": "Portrait of Erasmus of Rotterdam",
          "readAt": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Portrait_of_Erasmus_of_Rotterdam",
          "accessed": "2026-11-04",
          "tier": 5,
          "publisher": "Wikipedia",
          "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0"
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "quote",
        "text": "Recently I sent again two portraits of Erasmus to France, painted by a very skillful artist.",
        "lead": "Erasmus wrote in 1524:",
        "source": {
          "author": "Desiderius Erasmus",
          "title": "Portrait of Erasmus of Rotterdam",
          "readAt": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Portrait_of_Erasmus_of_Rotterdam",
          "accessed": "2026-11-04",
          "tier": 3,
          "publisher": "Wikipedia",
          "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0"
        }
      }
    ],
    "matters": [
      {
        "kind": "quote",
        "text": "The arts are freezing in this part of the world,\" he wrote, \"and he is on the way to England to pick up some angels",
